{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22236","headline":"赎鸡 · 白居易","name":"赎鸡","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"清晨临江望，水禽正諠繁。\n凫鴈与鸥鹭，游扬戏朝暾。\n适有鬻鸡者，挈之来远村。\n飞鸣彼何乐，窘束此何冤。\n喔喔十四雏，罩缚同一樊。\n足伤金距蹜，头抢花冠飜。\n经宿废饮啄，日高诣屠门。\n迟回未死间，饥渴欲相吞。\n常慕古人道，仁信及鱼豚。\n见兹生恻隐，赎放双林园。\n开笼解索时，鸡鸡听我言。\n与尔镪三百，小惠何足论。\n莫学衔环雀，崎岖谩报恩。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22236.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22236","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}